# Line endings: text files are stored and checked out with LF on every system, so a checkout on
# Windows contains the same bytes as on Linux and macOS (e.g. the sample invoice XML that is
# embedded into PDFs). Git detects binary files itself; the list below makes it explicit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.icc binary
*.pdf binary
